      "content": "Suppose that\n\n<br><br><p>Box-I contains 8 red, 3 blue and 5 green balls, <br><br>Box-II contains 24 red, 9 blue and 15 green balls,<br><br> Box-III contains 1 blue, 12 green and 3 yellow balls, <br><br>Box-IV contains 10 green, 16 orange and 6 white balls.</p>\n\n<p>A ball is chosen randomly from Box-I; call this ball <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.971ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 429 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.971ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 429 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is red then a ball is chosen randomly from Box-II, if <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.971ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 429 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is blue then a ball is chosen randomly from Box-III, and if <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.971ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 429 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D44F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D44F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is green then a ball is chosen randomly from Box-IV. The conditional probability of the event 'one of the chosen balls is white' given that the event 'at least one of the chosen balls is green' has happened, is equal to</p>",
